247415,\"title\":\"Girls, Let's Defy Fate\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pE1CAuAzYkB0efybL29lYA51jBn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2189873417721519,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":3238,\"title\":\"Juken Sentai Gekiranger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/56voge0oikHcRUuA8JEGaVyleFl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2123287671232877,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":214873,\"title\":\"My School President\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zK3cdksy41NaIvXWVVxltBM45aX.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2109090909090909,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"In season two, the members of the Doom Patrol now find themselves mini-sized and stranded on Cliff’s toy race car track. Here they begin to deal with their feelings of betrayal by The Chief, while confronting their own personal baggage. And as each member faces the challenge of growing beyond their own past traumatic experiences, they must come together to embrace and protect the newest member of the family: Dorothy Spinner, Niles’ daughter, whose powers remain a mysterious but real threat to bringing on the end of the world.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jAE8EBxIW2JFuDHK4NotdjulGm9.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2020-06-25\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Fun Size Patrol\",\"overview\":\"The Doom Patrol (along with Niles & his daughter) are still mini-sized after their last adventure. Ultimately, Niles will have to sacrifice something precious to save the team.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4E1YcapLlF0gKM0e3dSCPquFGw2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":31,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-25\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Tyme Patrol\",\"overview\":\"Cliff, Jane, and Rita pursue a time-altering doctor in their reluctant quest to help Niles and Dorothy. Meanwhile, Vic meets a military vet who challenges his beliefs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/arDjDqLfMCxtYSol0MoeusnYa3J.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":30,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-25\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Pain Patrol\",\"overview\":\"Niles, Rita, and Larry end up in the interdimensional clutches of Red Jack, an infamous villain who feeds on pain, while Cliff visits his daughter with Jane.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7eEoQjJeOPKcBkNa2QOOaqWwcH8.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":30,\"airDate\":\"2020-06-25\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Sex Patrol\",\"overview\":\"When the Dannyzens throw a massive party at Doom Manor to resuscitate Danny the Brick, Dorothy longs to join the festivities and experience life as a grown-up. As the party rages on, Rita asks Flex Mentallo to help unleash her full potential -- which has some dangerously racy consequences.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pLmS4K2Ci3fOqu70K18jtmfKxO8.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":29,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-02\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Finger Patrol\",\"overview\":\"Dorothy finds a friend in Baby Doll, while Vic looks to win Roni back. With Rita’s help, Larry finally tries to break the ice with his family.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ib6DSxiApmwhECE8BImuoZzs6o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":25,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-09\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Space Patrol\",\"overview\":\"As Niles and Cliff set out to find a missing Dorothy, Larry is tasked with handling Niles’ old research team when the ageless aeronauts return from space.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c93l1Q7CEzIn0w6zFYjXDQQL00a.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":21,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-16\",\"runtime\":51},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Dumb Patrol\",\"overview\":\"While Niles heads north to find Dorothy’s mother, the Doom Patrol embraces their inner morons after receiving a mysterious package.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lnMcJ7KQ3rbfceKxAeSP3rIsBgw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"voteCount\":19,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-23\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Dad Patrol\",\"overview\":\"While Jane sets out to prove her worth in The Underground, Cliff goes into “dad” mode and Niles devotes a day to Dorothy, who’s finally growing up.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/haGXVysgMev060Rp7QJKAN7oagJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":22,\"airDate\":\"2020-07-30\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Wax Patrol\",\"overview\":\"Before the Doom Patrol can answer a call to save the world from The Candlemaker in the season finale, they must first battle long-forgotten imaginary friends.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nlI6o5l04ovzy7W3YNWTokwMuwN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"voteCount\":22,\"airDate\":\"2020-08-06\",\"runtime\":46}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-02-15\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}